# The Flipside of Things (crystalWar 11): a level 99 Warrior in Garlaige Citadel [S] (missions as group 1's flows).
# Rarcasmeault: a Lilac: nil (no trade handler); 6, finished on options 0 and 2: nothing; 6, option 1: begun. No case:
# 8 (an Event). _qm2 7, finished: the Firepower Case; again: nil (5). Rarcasmeault 9, finished: completed (2000 exp,
# 2000 gil, the Map of Vunkerl Inlet), the case taken; again: 4 (replaceDefault). _qm2 completed: nil (5).
lists GarlaigeCitadelS/Rarcasmeault/onTrade GarlaigeCitadelS/Rarcasmeault/onTrigger GarlaigeCitadelS/_qm2/onTrigger GarlaigeCitadelS/onEventFinish/6 GarlaigeCitadelS/onEventFinish/7 GarlaigeCitadelS/onEventFinish/9
char zone=GarlaigeCitadelS pos=147.675,-6,93.04 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
item Lilac
login
trade Rarcasmeault Lilac x1             # available: nil (no trade handler)
trigger Rarcasmeault                    # available: 6
finish option=0                         # nothing
trigger Rarcasmeault                    # 6
finish option=2                         # nothing (only option 1 begins)
trigger Rarcasmeault                    # 6
finish option=1                         # begun
trigger Rarcasmeault                    # no case: 8
finish
trigger _qm2                            # no case: 7
finish                                  # the Firepower Case
trigger _qm2                            # the case: nil (5)
finish-if-event
trigger Rarcasmeault                    # the case: 9
finish                                  # completed (2000 exp, 2000 gil, the map); the case taken
trigger Rarcasmeault                    # completed: 4 (replaceDefault)
finish
trigger _qm2                            # completed: nil (5)
finish-if-event
